cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AxonOS Swarm"
message: >-
  If you reference or build against this component of the AxonOS
  project, please cite it using the metadata below. The canonical
  specification is the axonos-standard repository.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Denis
    family-names: Yermakou
    affiliation: "AxonOS Project"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AxonOS-org/axonos-swarm"
url: "https://axonos.org"
abstract: >-
  An experimental real-time coordination layer for AxonOS mesh nodes:
  Kalman-filtered Neural PTP clock synchronisation, synchronised epoch
  scheduling, co-availability window estimation, and bounded fault
  detection. Implements the Swarm Real-Time Contract SC0–SC6 defined in
  AxonOS RFC-0008. no_std Rust on ARM Cortex-M.
keywords:
  - brain-computer interface
  - real-time systems
  - distributed systems
  - clock synchronisation
  - operating system
  - neurotechnology
  - rust
license: [Apache-2.0, MIT]
version: "0.2.2"
date-released: "2026-05-27"
